---
import GuiaLayout from '../../layouts/GuiaLayout.astro';
---
<GuiaLayout
  title="Privacy policy — Cometia"
  description="Privacy policy for the Cometia guide."
  lang="en"
  canonical="/en/privacy"
  altUrl="/privacidad"
>
  <section class="ficha wrap">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <div class="prose" style="max-width:720px">
      <p>Cometia is an informational web guide. We don't ask you to register and we don't collect personal data just to browse. We only handle data if you email us voluntarily.</p>
      <h2>Third-party data</h2>
      <p>Venue data comes from <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenStreetMap</a> (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL licence). Maps are shown via OpenStreetMap and rating links point to Google Maps, each with its own privacy policy.</p>
      <h2>Analytics & cookies</h2>
      <p>We may use analytics in an aggregated, anonymous way to understand how the site is used and improve it. If we add advertising in future, we'll update this page.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For any privacy question: <a href="mailto:cometia.es@gmail.com">cometia.es@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      <p class="ftr__attr">Last updated: 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</GuiaLayout>
